#
#
# CONSEQUENCE
# -----------
#
# GROUP A:
#   XGBoost / LightGBM / CatBoost / FT ensemble
#
#   Complete E2E unavailable because the deployment path requires the
#   70-feature representation/extraction boundary, which Stage26 has not
#   profiled.
